# Wedding colour palette

Use these as the main brand colours for the wedding website. Prefer the named CSS variables in `style.css` rather than hardcoding hex values.

| Name | Hex | CSS variable | Typical use |
|------|-----|--------------|-------------|
| Matcha | `#b4a64b` | `--matcha` | Accents, markers, highlights |
| Velvet | `#591e2a` | `--velvet` | Buttons, strong accents, ampersand |
| Pink Silk | `#d6a6b1` | `--pink-silk` | Soft accents, borders, secondary highlights |
| Moss | `#464719` | `--moss` | Headings, primary dark text accents |

Supporting surfaces already derived from this palette:

- `--cream`, `--warm-white`, `--soft-pink` for backgrounds
- `--text`, `--muted` for body copy
- `--border` for dividers and outlines

When adding new UI, stay within this palette. Do not reintroduce the old sage/green scheme.
